Bootstrap Tooltip
1. Basic Tooltip
<a href="#"
   data-toggle="tooltip"
   title="Bu tooltip!">
    Hover over me
</a>
2. Tooltipni ishga tushirish
Bootstrap 3 Tooltip jQuery orqali initialize qilinishi kerak.
<script>
$(document).ready(function(){
    $('[data-toggle="tooltip"]').tooltip();
});
</script>
3. Tooltip joylashuvi

Default holatda Tooltip tepada chiqadi.

data-placement bilan joyini o‘zgartiramiz.

Top
<a href="#"
   data-toggle="tooltip"
   data-placement="top"
   title="Yuqorida chiqadi">
    Hover
</a>
4. To‘liq kichik misol
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Bootstrap Tooltip</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet"
          href="https://maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/3.4.1/css/bootstrap.min.css">

    <script src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/3.7.1/jquery.min.js"></script>

    <script src="https://maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/3.4.1/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <h2>Tooltip</h2>

        <button class="btn btn-primary"
                data-toggle="tooltip"
                data-placement="top"
                title="Bu Search button">
            Search
        </button>

    </div>

    <script>
    $(document).ready(function(){
        $('[data-toggle="tooltip"]').tooltip();
    });
    </script>

</body>
</html>
