32. Bootstrap Tooltip
→ Element ustiga mouse olib kelganda chiqadigan kichik popup text.

data-toggle="tooltip"
→ Tooltip ekanligini bildiradi

title
→ Tooltip ichidagi text

.tooltip()
→ Tooltipni ishga tushiradi

$(document).ready()
→ Sahifa tayyor bo‘lgandan keyin kodni ishlatadi

data-placement="top"
→ tepada

data-placement="bottom"
→ pastda

data-placement="left"
→ chapda

data-placement="right"
→ o‘ngda
